  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "###\n\nA clear, comprehensive list of regions and areas supported by Persona’s service is needed to avoid confusion and ensure inclusivity.\n\n###\n\nIt seems there isn’t a comprehensive list of areas supported by Persona’s service available online. This creates uncertainty for VRChat players from less mainstream regions, such as Brazil, Malaysia, Russia, Mainland China, Hong Kong, Taiwan, and others. A significant number of players could be affected if Persona’s service does not extend to these locations.\n\nIf Persona does not support these areas, players holding identification documents from these regions would be unable to complete Age Verification, restricting their access to age-restricted instances and content.\n\nA clear, comprehensive list of regions and areas supported by Persona’s service is needed to avoid confusion and ensure inclusivity.",
